  "permlink": "https://cafe.daum.net/sedu22/f9Wr/41",
  "contentHtml": "<p style=\"text-align: center;\">메모앱으로 할 일들을 <b><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">나열식 기록</span></b>하신다면<br>To do 리스트 작성으로<br>넘어오시는 것은 어떠신지요.<br>&#160;<br>(시간나면 올려봐야지 했는데,<br>너무 늦은 감이 있네요.ㅎㅎ ^^;;)<br>&#160;<br>전세계 10억명의 선택!<br><b><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">MS 사의 to do 앱</span></b>을 소개합니다.<br>&#160;</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/d9c29a1ce4132d9effc5d54e4a3c92aaaec01ce0\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"261\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/d9c29a1ce4132d9effc5d54e4a3c92aaaec01ce0\" data-origin-width=\"300\" data-origin-height=\"239\"></div><hr data-ke-style=\"style2\"><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/35263cf2a170077d15fd7e6326efcaa9dbddac3e\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/35263cf2a170077d15fd7e6326efcaa9dbddac3e\" data-origin-width=\"300\" data-origin-height=\"473\"></div><p style=\"text-align: center;\">이렇게 생긴 위젯입니다.&#160;<br>할 일을 한줄씩 기록할 수 있고,<br><b><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">완료시 앞의 O 표를 누르면 사라집니다.&#160;</span></b><br>&#160;<br>O 할 일이 <b><span style=\"color: #EE2323;\">클리어되는 맛.</span></b><br>그것이 이 앱의 매력이죠.<br>&#160;</p><div class=\"imagegridblock\" data-ke-type=\"imageGrid\"><div class=\"image-container\"><span data-url=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/1e329fb6f05351ec6c199a173922591f03b57a57\" data-origin-width=\"300\" data-origin-height=\"683\" style=\"width:50.00%; margin-right: 10px;\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/1e329fb6f05351ec6c199a173922591f03b57a57\" class=\"txc-image-grid\"></span><span data-url=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/d5e11107d6e99257f407b43bf80ee44625cd1841\" data-origin-width=\"300\" data-origin-height=\"683\" style=\"width:50.00%; \"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/d5e11107d6e99257f407b43bf80ee44625cd1841\" class=\"txc-image-grid\"></span></div><div class=\"figcaption\"></div></div><p style=\"text-align: center;\">&#160;<br>위젯을 설치합니다.<br>크기를 자유롭게 조절할 수 있구요. <br>&#160;<br>우측에 <b><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">+ 버튼을 누르고 </span></b><br><b><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">할 일을</span></b> 넣으면 됩니다.&#160;<br>&#160;</p><div class=\"imagegridblock\" data-ke-type=\"imageGrid\"><div class=\"image-container\"><span data-url=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/05d0785d0683d6947b4bb36eeed8b8dcedb05b69\" data-origin-width=\"300\" data-origin-height=\"683\" style=\"width:50.00%; margin-right: 10px;\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/05d0785d0683d6947b4bb36eeed8b8dcedb05b69\" class=\"txc-image-grid\"></span><span data-url=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/2b579c07eb43664c37786171ea5b8a120a68b63f\" data-origin-width=\"300\" data-origin-height=\"683\" style=\"width:50.00%; \"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/2b579c07eb43664c37786171ea5b8a120a68b63f\" class=\"txc-image-grid\"></span></div><div class=\"figcaption\"></div></div><p style=\"text-align: center;\">&#160;<br>&lt;ot준비&gt;라고 넣고<br><b><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">오른쪽 화살표를 누르면 입력완료!</span></b><br>&#160;<br>간단하죠.<br>&#160;<br>나중에 넣은 할 일이 위쪽으로 자동배열됩니다.<br>하지만, 우측 &#9733; 을 누르면<br>아래 있던 것도 위로 갑니다.<br>즉, <b><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">중요한 일은 &#9733;을 누르면 됩니다.</span></b><br>&#160;</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/355d8fc68d32e1377a1c901db16ba323b760c96d\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/355d8fc68d32e1377a1c901db16ba323b760c96d\" data-origin-width=\"300\" data-origin-height=\"683\"></div><p style=\"text-align: center;\">&#160;<br>이 어플의 장점은<br><b><span style=\"color: #EE2323;\">할 일에 따라 위젯을 여러개</span></b> 만들 수 있는데요.<br><b><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">학교, 집, 아이디어, 수업, 살 것</span></b> 등등<br>몸&#46489;이는 하나인데.... 할 일은 참....ㅠㅅㅠ<br><br><br>여기까지 기본 설명 끝!<br><br>----------------------------------------<br><br>&lt;심화편&gt;으로 넘어가볼까요. ^^<br>&#160;<br>목록 이름을 내맘대로 여러개 만들어볼께요. <br>&#160;</p><div class=\"imagegridblock\" data-ke-type=\"imageGrid\"><div class=\"image-container\"><span data-url=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/1e329fb6f05351ec6c199a173922591f03b57a57\" data-origin-width=\"300\" data-origin-height=\"683\" style=\"width:50.01%; margin-right: 10px;\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/1e329fb6f05351ec6c199a173922591f03b57a57\" class=\"txc-image-grid\"></span><span data-url=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/86615d0fb0c6c633acd9eb8eaf4d28d21007c765\" data-origin-width=\"648\" data-origin-height=\"1476\" style=\"width:49.99%; \"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/86615d0fb0c6c633acd9eb8eaf4d28d21007c765\" class=\"txc-image-grid\"></span></div><div class=\"figcaption\"></div></div><p style=\"text-align: center;\">&#160;<br>1번 탭을 누르면, 할 일이 주르륵 보이고,<br><b><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">하단에는 완료한 할 일</span></b>도 보입니다.<br>2번을&#160; back 버튼을 누르면<br>&#160;<br>하단에 <b><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">&lt;새목록&gt;을 눌러 </span></b><br><span data-ke-size=\"size18\"><b>마음대로 목록을</b> </span>만들 수 있습니다.&#160;<br>&#160;</p><div class=\"imagegridblock\" data-ke-type=\"imageGrid\"><div class=\"image-container\"><span data-url=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/cc85e01f25d8f4d512f940ed20f69afc73c00447\" data-origin-width=\"648\" data-origin-height=\"1476\" style=\"width:49.99%; margin-right: 10px;\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/cc85e01f25d8f4d512f940ed20f69afc73c00447\" class=\"txc-image-grid\"></span><span data-url=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/a024db33a33b18d1b40642f61dac63b1280c453e\" data-origin-width=\"300\" data-origin-height=\"683\" style=\"width:50.01%; \"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/a024db33a33b18d1b40642f61dac63b1280c453e\" class=\"txc-image-grid\"></span></div><div class=\"figcaption\"></div></div><p style=\"text-align: center;\">&#160;<br>3번 새목록을 눌러, 목록을 추가합니다.<br>&#160;</p><div class=\"imagegridblock\" data-ke-type=\"imageGrid\"><div class=\"image-container\"><span data-url=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/76195f065c2ae840e060d1ab8305b8cfc7cb8631\" data-origin-width=\"300\" data-origin-height=\"683\" style=\"width:50.00%; margin-right: 10px;\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/76195f065c2ae840e060d1ab8305b8cfc7cb8631\" class=\"txc-image-grid\"></span><span data-url=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/fd82ac62ae07c878372c32b3d4e38dfe33cbf082\" data-origin-width=\"300\" data-origin-height=\"683\" style=\"width:50.00%; \"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/fd82ac62ae07c878372c32b3d4e38dfe33cbf082\" class=\"txc-image-grid\"></span></div><div class=\"figcaption\"></div></div><p style=\"text-align: center;\">&#160;<br>새 목록에 이름을 넣고,<br>위젯에&#160; 4번을 눌러<br><b><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">나오게 하고싶은 목록을 설정</span></b>할 수 있습니다.<br>&#160;<br>&#160;<br>위에는 스마트목록(기본),<br>하단에 직접 만든 목록<br><b><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">띄우고 싶은 목록</span></b>을 누르세요.<br>&#160;</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/20e604bb5e62058ae1bb2660d5415b088e5abf84\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/20e604bb5e62058ae1bb2660d5415b088e5abf84\" data-origin-width=\"300\" data-origin-height=\"683\"></div><p style=\"text-align: center;\">&#160;<br>저는 잘 쓰지 않지만,<br>메모마다 <b><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">띄우는 시간이나 반복 옵션</span></b>도<br>가능합니다.<br>&#160;</p><div class=\"imagegridblock\" data-ke-type=\"imageGrid\"><div class=\"image-container\"><span data-url=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/7fc8bbb9bd7d7d83f4b8bbcf338ba3cb1de3bbe3\" data-origin-width=\"648\" data-origin-height=\"1476\" style=\"width:50.00%; margin-right: 10px;\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/7fc8bbb9bd7d7d83f4b8bbcf338ba3cb1de3bbe3\" class=\"txc-image-grid\"></span><span data-url=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/fa7fdeb7b628b43a628310218bfc14011f8dbcca\" data-origin-width=\"648\" data-origin-height=\"1476\" style=\"width:50.00%; \"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/fa7fdeb7b628b43a628310218bfc14011f8dbcca\" class=\"txc-image-grid\"></span></div><div class=\"figcaption\"></div></div><p style=\"text-align: center;\">&#160;<br><b><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">완료됨을 누르면, </span></b><br>완료된 것을 안보이게도 할 수 있습니다.<br>&#160;</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/9c4b8df4c73386a708b1ca1f7d079677fe49afc9\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"507\" height=\"547\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/9c4b8df4c73386a708b1ca1f7d079677fe49afc9\" data-origin-width=\"963\" data-origin-height=\"1039\"></div><p style=\"text-align: center;\">&#160;<br>MS꺼라, PC 동기화는 기본이죠<br>윈도우11 하단에 날씨뜨는<br><b><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">&lt;위젯&gt;에 마우스 올리면 </span></b><br><b><span style=\"color: #EE2323;\">오른쪽 상단에 + 로 To Do 앱</span></b>이<br>나오게 할 수 있습니다.<br>&#160;<br>&#160;<br><b>새학기</b><br><b>&#54299;팅!</b><br>&#160;</p>\n\t \t\t\t\t\t<!-- -->",
